# Never commit ROMs by accident anywhere else in the project...
*.smc
*.sfc
*.fig
*.swc

# ...except the one we deliberately bundle into the app (private repo only -
# see README). Git needs the negation listed after the broader *.sfc rule.
!app/src/main/assets/webretro/roms/*.sfc
